{
  "bodyHash": "ZwT1lQuTE/A=",
  "content": "<p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveAircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Github\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fimmersive-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"透過 Crowdin 翻譯\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=crowdin&amp;color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p><p>\n這個模組新增了一系列樸實的飛行器，讓你能旅行、運輸和探索！\n這些飛行器著重於忠於原版風格，擁有許多細節與功能，但不會過於複雜。\n</p><p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/atlas?minecraft_version=1.20.1&amp;locations=_immersive_aircraft:aircraft&amp;dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveAircraft/tree/1.20.1?&amp;c=1&amp;resolution=48&amp;background=fancy&amp;row_size=10\" alt=\"生成的 Atlas 圖片\"></p><p>喔對了，支援多人遊玩！</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/screen1.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\"></p><h1>雙翼機</h1><p>先從經典的雙翼機開始吧。速度快，單人座，操作難度中等。</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/biplane.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\"></p><h1>飛船</h1><p>速度較慢，但有兩個座位。操作相當簡單，靠著後方的引擎擁有可接受的速度。還有體積更大的貨運版本！</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/airship.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\"></p><h1>旋翼機</h1><p>人力驅動的原始雙座飛行器。可靠，但既不是最快也不是最容易飛行的。需要一個好的初始推力來讓旋翼轉動。</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/gyrodyne.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\"></p><h1>四軸飛行器</h1><p>工程的傑作！四個螺旋槳綁在一堆竹子上。對於建築來說相當方便。</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/quadrocopter.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\"></p><h1>戰艦</h1><p>\n由銅和鋼打造的猛獸，為征服天空而生！\n四個座位、可旋轉砲塔、6 個武器掛載點，體積大到連 Minecraft 的物理引擎都有點吃不消。\n</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/warship.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\"></p><h1>一些可以改造的物品</h1><p>由於飛行器通常比船之類的東西更複雜，因此新增了一些物品，讓製作飛行器感覺更像是在實際組裝東西。</p><p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/recipes?minecraft_version=1.20.1&amp;locations=immersive_aircraft:.*&amp;dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveAircraft/tree/1.20.1?&amp;c=1&amp;resolution=16&amp;animated=False&amp;row_width=835\" alt=\"生成的合成配方圖片\"></p><h1>物品欄</h1><p>升級欄位、燃料、旗幟、染料、火箭推進器和儲物空間。賦予你的飛行器個人風格！</p><p><img width=\"550\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=550,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/screenshots/inventory.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\"></p><h1>眾多升級</h1><p>按照你的喜好升級和調整你的飛行器！</p><p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/atlas?minecraft_version=1.20.1&amp;locations=_immersive_aircraft:upgrades&amp;dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveAircraft/tree/1.20.1?&amp;c=1&amp;resolution=48&amp;background=fancy&amp;row_size=10\" alt=\"生成的 Atlas 圖片\"></p><p>在你的飛行器上安裝各種武器和工具！</p><p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/atlas?minecraft_version=1.20.1&amp;locations=_immersive_aircraft:weapons&amp;dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveAircraft/tree/1.20.1?&amp;c=1&amp;resolution=48&amp;background=fancy&amp;row_size=10\" alt=\"生成的 Atlas 圖片\"></p><h1>影片</h1><span><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-XOlaZHOu4I?wmode=transparent\" height=\"480\" width=\"836\"></iframe></span></span><h1>附加元件</h1><p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/man-of-many-planes\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Man of Many Planes&amp;description=一組為 Immersive Aircraft 新增的附加飛行器，並考慮到 Create 的相容性。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Man of Many Planes\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-machinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Machinery&amp;description=一系列用於運輸、採礦和自動化工作的樸實機械。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Machinery\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aviator-dreams\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Aviator Dreams&amp;description=從小型到大型的真實飛機。&amp;icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1100/961/64/64/638648594348458560.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Aviator Dreams\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ia-remaining-airborne\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Remaining Airborne&amp;description=一組經典戰鬥機。&amp;icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1168/829/64/64/638739800864929977.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Remaining Airborne\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/warfare-wings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Warfare Wings&amp;description=新增了許多塗裝設計不同的二戰戰鬥機。&amp;icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1225/83/64/64/638802892619093611.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Warfare Wings\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fia_engines\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Better Engines&amp;description=新增了許多新的升級，主要是引擎，但也包括渦輪增壓器和機械增壓器。&amp;icon_url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/legoaggelos/ia_engines/refs/heads/main/common/src/main/resources/assets/more_engines/textures/item/supercharger.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Better Engines\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/civilian-aviation\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Civilian Aviation&amp;description=收錄了各個時代風格化的真實飛機和直升機！&amp;icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1808/958/256/256/639144393942056440.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Civilian Aviation\">\n</a></p><h1>資源包</h1><p>不喜歡我的風格和/或想要更好的 Create 整合？來看看這些超棒的資源包吧！</p><p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/more-immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=More Immersive Aircraft&amp;description=為 Immersive Aircraft 提供忠於原版且更真實的紋理。&amp;icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1180/610/64/64/638753853503436917.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"More Immersive Aircraft\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-immersive-aircrafts-resource-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Create Immersive Aircraft&amp;description;Create 風格的 Immersive Aircraft 資源包與資料包。&amp;icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/849/496/64/64/638250478085753003.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Create Immersive Aircraft\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-style-modded-compats\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Create Style Compats&amp;description=Create 風格的物品紋理。&amp;icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/485/413/64/64/637785634308178232.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Create Style Compats\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/faithful-32x-immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Faithful - Immersive Aircrafts&amp;description=Immersive Aircraft 的 FAITHFUL 32x 資源包。&amp;icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/798/431/64/64/638160303843226902.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Faithful - Immersive Aircrafts\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-immersive-aircraft-warship\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Create IA: Warship&amp;description=為戰艦提供的 Create 風格紋理。&amp;icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1004/277/64/64/638525212330806757.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Create IA: Warship\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-immersive-aircrafts-andesite-chests-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Create Andesite Chests&amp;description=為所有飛行器提供的 Create 風格安山岩儲物箱。&amp;icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1010/406/64/64/638534030337746940.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Create Andesite Chests\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/danceboys-biplane-to-xwing\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Danceboys X-wing&amp;description=將雙翼機替換為 X-wing！&amp;icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1327/379/64/64/638862867702387346.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Danceboys X-wing\">\n</a></p><h1>沉浸式收藏</h1><p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Armors&amp;description=許多獨特且忠於原版的盔甲套裝。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Armors\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Aircraft&amp;description=一系列樸實的飛行器，讓你能旅行、運輸和探索！&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Aircraft\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-melodies\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Melodies&amp;description=用各種樂器演奏自訂旋律，讓你的朋友們抓狂！&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Melodies\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Paintings&amp;description=拖放、像素化並懸掛美麗的藝術品。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Paintings\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-optimization\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Optimization&amp;description=一個用於將 TPS 翻倍的輕量級實體刻調度器。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Optimization\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selectivebounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=SelectiveBounds&amp;description=在不相關時隱藏醜陋的方塊選擇輪廓。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"SelectiveBounds\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-furniture\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Furniture&amp;description;在遊戲中創建自訂且精美的家具，或從龐大的線上圖書館中選擇。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Furniture\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-gateways\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Gateways&amp;description=散落在主世界各處、早已被遺忘的神秘傳送門。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Gateways\">\n</a></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=172ed73c9c7b23b143085297e790a860\" alt=\"用於更輕鬆部署頁面的頁面雜湊值。\"></p>",
